free-transcribe bundles no model weights. Everything below is downloaded by the
browser at runtime, directly from the Hugging Face CDN, and is cached locally.

Speech recognition
------------------
ivrit-ai/whisper-large-v3-turbo-onnx            Apache-2.0
  Hebrew fine-tune of OpenAI Whisper large-v3-turbo by ivrit.ai
  (https://www.ivrit.ai/), trained on roughly 5,050 hours of Hebrew.
  Base model: openai/whisper-large-v3-turbo, MIT.

onnx-community/whisper-large-v3-turbo_timestamped   MIT
onnx-community/whisper-small_timestamped           MIT
onnx-community/whisper-base_timestamped            MIT
  ONNX exports of OpenAI Whisper. Copyright (c) 2022 OpenAI.

Speaker diarization
-------------------
onnx-community/pyannote-segmentation-3.0        MIT
  ONNX export of pyannote/segmentation-3.0 by Herve Bredin.
  If you use it in academic work, please cite:
    Bredin, H. "pyannote.audio 2.1 speaker diarization pipeline", Interspeech 2023.

onnx-community/wespeaker-voxceleb-resnet34-LM   CC-BY-4.0
  ONNX export of the WeSpeaker ResNet34 speaker-embedding model trained on
  VoxCeleb, by the WeSpeaker team (https://github.com/wenet-e2e/wespeaker).
  Used unmodified. CC-BY-4.0 requires attribution, which this notice provides.
