Optional runtime dependency
---------------------------
@ffmpeg/ffmpeg and @ffmpeg/core are fetched from a CDN, and only when a file
is in a container the browser cannot decode on its own. They are LGPL-licensed
and are never bundled into this application or linked into it at build time.
